  "meaning": "to be; am / is / are",
  "pos": ["verb"],
  "usage": [
    "Used as the Cantonese copula meaning \"to be\".",
    "Commonly used to identify, describe, or say what someone or something is.",
    "係 is the normal spoken Cantonese form, while 是 is more formal or written."
